The logic followed here is: 

T - 1 = S; 

E - 1 = D; 

M - 1 = L;

P - 1 = O;

L - 1 = K;

E - 1 = D; further these codes are written in reverse order. Hence, DKOLDS.

Similarly,

W - 1 = V 

O - 1 = N; 

R - 1 = Q;

S - 1 = R;

H - 1 = G;

I - 1 = H;

P - 1 = O;

Further these codes are written in reverse order. Hence, 'OHGRQNV' is the correct answer.
